# Core

- Read `AGENTS.md`. Before product code, read `plans/00-north-star.md`.
- No hosted runtime deps: Neon, Clerk, Auth0, Firebase, AWS S3, OpenAI-in-product, SendGrid, etc.
- Portal must remain one-command local: Postgres, MinIO, Redis, Mailpit.
- Role checks live in the API. Curl is the test. UI hiding is not isolation.
- Never claim a tier the official suite did not pass. No fake `acceptance-report.txt`.
- Product code is allowed against `context/` and `plans/`. When official spec/fixtures/suite drop, reconcile before claiming tiers. No fake `acceptance-report.txt`.
- Do not rewrite Gavel, JunctionApp, Dribdat, Quill, or Hibiscus.
- Prefer editing plans/context over expanding scope.
- AI drafts are untrusted until `Reviewed: <name> <date>`.
